    "is_free": true,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349840/extras/4f0192a15c2cae819113b70ff2d7285d.poster.avif?t=1753943598\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349840/extras/4f0192a15c2cae819113b70ff2d7285d.webm?t=1753943598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349840/extras/4f0192a15c2cae819113b70ff2d7285d.mp4?t=1753943598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>InKing</strong> is an <strong>fast-paced ink action rogue-lite</strong>. Scatter and absorb the ink to win the crown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Journey of the Ink Warrior</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349840/extras/c7958946cc1b380aa51be1a6f8e66d01.poster.avif?t=1753943598\" width=600 height=118 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349840/extras/c7958946cc1b380aa51be1a6f8e66d01.webm?t=1753943598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349840/extras/c7958946cc1b380aa51be1a6f8e66d01.mp4?t=1753943598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an <strong>Ink Warrior</strong>,\u00a0embark on a journey to become the king of tools. Use your fast attacks, moves, and powerful skills to defeat the tools that stand in your way and prove that ink and pen are the best tools!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Absorb Ink!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349840/extras/47abb21badad355bc3a900d4e0b4fe27.poster.avif?t=1753943598\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349840/extras/47abb21badad355bc3a900d4e0b4fe27.webm?t=1753943598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349840/extras/47abb21badad355bc3a900d4e0b4fe27.mp4?t=1753943598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize the ink splashes to unleash powerful skills. Ink splatters in different ways, so make sure to time your ink splatters correctly for a smooth battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don't let your guard down!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349840/extras/3044329817e3940b74f4becfb2d38deb.poster.avif?t=1753943598\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349840/extras/3044329817e3940b74f4becfb2d38deb.webm?t=1753943598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349840/extras/3044329817e3940b74f4becfb2d38deb.mp4?t=1753943598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't stop until the waves of enemies stop coming. Because there will be a break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Power Up Yourself!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349840/extras/9bb905bec634e0f811bf91f2196ea872.poster.avif?t=1753943598\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349840/extras/9bb905bec634e0f811bf91f2196ea872.webm?t=1753943598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349840/extras/9bb905bec634e0f811bf91f2196ea872.mp4?t=1753943598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve yourself as you take down your enemies. From simple stats to a variety of attributes, customize your skills the way you want them to work for you and take on stronger enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Face Diverse Bosses!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349840/extras/d1a52123ad9222e0a82018b1a690293e.poster.avif?t=1753943598\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349840/extras/d1a52123ad9222e0a82018b1a690293e.webm?t=1753943598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349840/extras/d1a52123ad9222e0a82018b1a690293e.mp4?t=1753943598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To claim the crown, the Ink Warrior must overcome monumental challenges. Defeat bosses by overcoming their unique attack patterns!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349840/extras/4f0192a15c2cae819113b70ff2d7285d.poster.avif?t=1753943598\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349840/extras/4f0192a15c2cae819113b70ff2d7285d.webm?t=1753943598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349840/extras/4f0192a15c2cae819113b70ff2d7285d.mp4?t=1753943598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>InKing</strong> is an <strong>fast-paced ink action rogue-lite</strong>. Scatter and absorb the ink to win the crown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Journey of the Ink Warrior</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349840/extras/c7958946cc1b380aa51be1a6f8e66d01.poster.avif?t=1753943598\" width=600 height=118 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349840/extras/c7958946cc1b380aa51be1a6f8e66d01.webm?t=1753943598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349840/extras/c7958946cc1b380aa51be1a6f8e66d01.mp4?t=1753943598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an <strong>Ink Warrior</strong>,\u00a0embark on a journey to become the king of tools. Use your fast attacks, moves, and powerful skills to defeat the tools that stand in your way and prove that ink and pen are the best tools!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Absorb Ink!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349840/extras/47abb21badad355bc3a900d4e0b4fe27.poster.avif?t=1753943598\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349840/extras/47abb21badad355bc3a900d4e0b4fe27.webm?t=1753943598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349840/extras/47abb21badad355bc3a900d4e0b4fe27.mp4?t=1753943598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize the ink splashes to unleash powerful skills. Ink splatters in different ways, so make sure to time your ink splatters correctly for a smooth battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don't let your guard down!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349840/extras/3044329817e3940b74f4becfb2d38deb.poster.avif?t=1753943598\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349840/extras/3044329817e3940b74f4becfb2d38deb.webm?t=1753943598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349840/extras/3044329817e3940b74f4becfb2d38deb.mp4?t=1753943598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't stop until the waves of enemies stop coming. Because there will be a break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Power Up Yourself!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349840/extras/9bb905bec634e0f811bf91f2196ea872.poster.avif?t=1753943598\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349840/extras/9bb905bec634e0f811bf91f2196ea872.webm?t=1753943598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349840/extras/9bb905bec634e0f811bf91f2196ea872.mp4?t=1753943598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve yourself as you take down your enemies. From simple stats to a variety of attributes, customize your skills the way you want them to work for you and take on stronger enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Face Diverse Bosses!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349840/extras/d1a52123ad9222e0a82018b1a690293e.poster.avif?t=1753943598\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349840/extras/d1a52123ad9222e0a82018b1a690293e.webm?t=1753943598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349840/extras/d1a52123ad9222e0a82018b1a690293e.mp4?t=1753943598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To claim the crown, the Ink Warrior must overcome monumental challenges. Defeat bosses by overcoming their unique attack patterns!</p>",
